          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "在公司縮編行銷部門後，她去年被裁員了。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Many factories are downsizing their workforce to cut costs in a slowing economy.",
          "highlight": [
            "downsizing"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "許多工廠正在縮減人力，以在經濟放缓時降低成本。"
